WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.291 --> 00:00:03.830
- [Narrator] Off the east
coast of China near Shanghai

00:00:03.830 --> 00:00:07.911
sits an archipelago of nearly 400 islands.

00:00:07.911 --> 00:00:10.282
One of them is Shengshan Island,

00:00:10.282 --> 00:00:12.121
a place where nature has reclaimed

00:00:12.121 --> 00:00:14.750
what was once a thriving fishing village.

00:00:14.750 --> 00:00:18.417
(gentle instrumental music)

00:00:19.876 --> 00:00:22.171
Residents started
leaving in the early '90s

00:00:22.171 --> 00:00:24.802
in search of areas where
access to mainland ports

00:00:24.802 --> 00:00:26.898
would be easier for business,

00:00:26.898 --> 00:00:31.426
and now lush greenery has taken
over the abandoned village.

00:00:31.426 --> 00:00:35.093
(gentle instrumental music)

